t** does not.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[shader-instance-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22588365/shader-instance-bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111020/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111020/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}